                                                "sense_id": "6c41b661-9c50-38cb-8e1b-77aae0474ba9",
                                                "text": "Repeated hammerings by the smith thin the metal and make it tough."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d3bd357-3418-4671-9ef3-0c4b750f94c8",
                                                "sense_id": "6c41b661-9c50-38cb-8e1b-77aae0474ba9",
                                                "text": "Hearing a hammering on the door, I ran downstairs to open it."
